<title>USA: Compaq cuts U.S. server prices up to 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Compaq cuts U.S. server prices up to 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp on Thursday said it cut U.S. prices on its ProLiant 2500 line of servers by up to 15 percent, effectively immediately.</p>
<p>The five server models' estimated prices now range from $5,100 to $7,750, the company said.</p>
<p>It added it had reduced U.S. prices on selected server storage, or hard drives, by up to 14 percent and on selected server memory by as much as 30 percent.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
